From 83d0d5b0f35d60a6510f128c96a63ee8ef91dc61 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igal Zeltser <izeltser@habana.ai>
Date: Thu, 13 Jan 2022 18:45:11 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-69581] gaudi3: create file tree

As a preparation of preboot build for gaudi3, minimal required source
files are added for asic onix and pldm.
The source files are empty and will be filled with content later.
In addition, minimal makefiles and linker files are added as well.

At the moment preboot build is panned for architecture Arc only.

Change-Id: I864006e27717742b5be595fef71e286d8dcfde5b
Signed-off-by: Igal Zeltser <izeltser@habana.ai>
---

